{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"德宗　順宗　憲宗","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"德宗神武聖文皇帝諱适，代宗長子也。母曰睿真皇太后沈氏。初，沈氏以開元末選入代宗宮。安祿山之亂，玄宗避賊于蜀，諸王妃妾不及從者，皆為賊所得，拘之東都之掖廷。代宗克東都，得沈氏，留之宮中；史思明再陷東都，遂失所在。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"肅宗元年建丑月，封德宗奉節郡王。代宗即位，史朝義據東都，乃以德宗為天下兵馬元帥，進封魯王。八月，徙封雍王。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"寶應元年十月，屯于陝州，諸將進擊史朝義，敗之，朝義走河北，遂克東都。十一月，史朝義死幽州，守將李懷仙斬其首來獻，河北平。以功兼尚書令，與功臣郭子儀、李光弼等皆賜鐵券，圖形凌煙閣。廣德二年二月，立為皇太子。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"大曆十四年五月辛酉，代宗崩。癸亥，即皇帝位于太極殿。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月甲戌，貶常袞為河南少尹，以河南少尹崔祐甫為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。丙子，罷諸州府及新羅、渤海貢鷹鷂。戊寅，罷山南貢枇杷、江南甘橘非供宗廟者。辛巳，罷邕府歲貢奴婢。癸未，罷梨園樂工三百人、劍南貢生春酒。甲申，郭子儀為尚父，兼太尉、中書令。丙戌，罷獻祥瑞，貢器以金銀飾者還之。丁亥，出宮人，放舞象三十有二于荊山之陽。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月己亥，大赦。賜文武官階、爵，民為戶者古爵一級。減乘輿服御。士庶田宅、車服踰制者，有司為立法度。禁百官置邸販鬻。武德、至德將相有功者子孫予官。庚子，進封子宣城郡王誦為宣王，封子謨為舒王，諶通王，諒虔王，詳肅王，謙資王。乙巳，封弟迺為益王，迅隋王，遂蜀王。丙午，詔六品以上清望官，日二人待制。癸丑，命皇族五等以上居四方者，家一人赴山陵。己未，罷揚州貢鏡、幽州貢麝。癸亥，舉可刺史、京令者。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月戊辰朔，日有食之。庚午，弛邕州金坑禁。辛卯，罷榷酤。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月甲辰，道州司馬楊炎為門下侍郎，懷州刺史喬琳為御史大夫：同中書門下平章事。乙巳，還吐蕃俘。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月丁酉，吐蕃、雲南蠻寇黎、茂、文、扶四州，鳳翔節度使朱泚、金吾衛大將軍曲環敗之于七盤城。己酉，葬睿文孝武皇帝于元陵。戊午，罷九成宮貢立獸炭、襄州蔗蒻工。辛酉，以沙苑豢豕三千給貧民。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月壬午，喬琳罷。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月乙卯，立宣王誦為皇太子。丙寅晦，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"建中元年正月丁卯，改元。羣臣上尊號曰聖神文武皇帝。己巳，朝獻于太清宮。庚午，朝享于太廟。辛未，有事于南郊，大赦。賜文武官階、勳、爵，遣黜陟使于天下，賜子為父後者勳兩轉。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月丙申，初定兩稅。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月乙未，四鎮、北庭行軍別駕劉文喜反于涇州，伏誅。己亥，地震。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月甲午，崔祐甫薨。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月丙寅，王國良降。己丑，殺忠州刺史劉晏。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月丁巳，遙尊母沈氏為皇太后。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月己卯，雷。庚寅，睦王述為奉迎皇太后使。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪。黃河、滹沱、易水溢。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二年正月戊辰，成德軍節度使李寶臣卒，其子惟岳自稱留後，幽州盧龍軍節度使朱滔討之。魏博節度使田悅反，神策都虞候李晟、河東節度使馬燧、昭義軍節度使李抱真、河陽節度副使李芃討之。永平軍節度使李勉為汴、滑、陳、懷、鄭、汝、陝、河陽三城、宋、亳、潁節度都統。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月乙巳，御史大夫盧杞為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。乙卯，振武軍亂，殺其使彭令芳及監軍劉惠光。丁巳，發兵屯關東，誓師于望春樓。山南東道節度使梁崇義反。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月，京師雨雹。庚申，置待詔官三十人。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月，熒惑、太白鬬于東井。癸巳，淮寧軍節度使李希烈為漢南、漢北兵馬招討使，以討梁崇義。辛丑，郭子儀薨。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月庚申，楊炎罷。檢校尚書右僕射侯希逸為司空，前永平軍節度使張鎰為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。侯希逸薨。癸未，馬燧、李抱真及田悅戰于臨洺，敗之。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月，劍南西川節度使張延賞、東川節度使王叔邕、山南東道節度使賈耽、荊南節度使李昌巙、陳少游討梁崇義，以李希烈為諸軍都統。辛卯，平盧軍節度使李正己卒，其子納自稱留後。壬子，梁崇義伏誅。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月，李納陷宋州。李惟岳將張孝忠以易、定二州降。壬戌，賜立功士卒帛，稟死事家三歲。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月戊申，李納將李洧以徐州降。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月辛酉，納寇徐州，宣武軍節度使劉洽敗之于七里溝。丁丑，馬燧及田悅戰于雙岡，敗之。甲申，李納將王涉以海州降。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月丁酉，馬萬通以密州降。馬燧為魏博招討使。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，殺崖州司馬楊炎。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三年正月丙寅，朱滔、成德軍節度使張孝忠及李惟岳戰于束鹿，敗之。辛未，減常膳及太子諸王食物。復榷酤。癸未，李納陷海、密二州。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月乙未，李惟岳將康日知以趙州降。甲辰，惟岳伏誅，其將楊榮國以深州降。庚戌，馬燧及田悅戰于洹水，敗之。是月，悅將李再春以博州降，田昂以洺州降。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月戊午，李惟岳將楊政義以定州降。甲戌，給復易、定、深、趙、恒、冀六州三年，赦吏民為李惟岳迫脅者。己卯，震通化門。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月戊午，李納將李士真以德、棣二州降。甲子，借商錢。甲戌，昭義軍節度副使盧玄卿為魏博、澶相招討使。戊寅，張鎰罷。壬午，殺殿中侍御史鄭詹。是月，朱滔反，陷德、棣二州。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月辛卯，朔方軍節度使李懷光討田悅。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月甲子，京師地震。恒冀觀察使王武俊反。辛巳，李懷光、馬燧、李芃、李抱真及朱滔、王武俊、田悅戰于連篋山，敗績。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月壬辰，殿中丞李雲端謀反，伏誅。癸巳，停借商錢令。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月癸丑，演州司馬李孟秋、峰州刺史皮岸反，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丁亥，初稅商錢、茶、漆、竹、木。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月丙辰，吏部侍郎關播為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。李希烈反。丙子，肅王詳薨。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四年正月丁亥，鳳翔節度使張鎰及吐蕃尚結贊盟于清水。庚寅，李希烈陷汝州，執刺史李元平。戊戌，東都、汝行營節度使哥舒曜討李希烈。二月丁卯，克汝州。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月辛卯，李希烈寇鄂州，刺史李兼敗之。丁酉，荊南節度使張伯儀及李希烈戰于安州，敗績。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月庚申，李勉為淮西招討處置使，哥舒曜副之；張伯儀為淮西應援招討使，賈耽、江南西道節度使嗣曹王皐副之。甲子，京師地震，生毛。丙子，哥舒曜及李希烈戰于潁橋，敗之。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月辛巳，京師地震。乙酉，潁王璬薨。乙未，劉洽為淄青、兗鄆招討制置使。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月庚戌，稅屋間架，筭除陌錢。丁卯，徙封逾為丹王，遘簡王。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月，馬燧為魏博、澶相節度招討使。壬辰，盧杞、關播、李忠臣及吐蕃區頰贊盟于京師。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月丁未，李希烈寇襄城。乙卯，希烈將曹季昌以隋州降。庚申，有星隕于京師。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丙戌，神策軍行營兵馬使劉德信及李希烈戰于扈澗，敗績。庚子，舒王謨為荊襄、江西、沔鄂節度諸軍行營兵馬都元帥，徙封普王。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，涇原節度使姚令言反，犯京師。戊申，如奉天。朱泚反。庚戌，泚殺司農卿段秀實及左驍衛將軍劉海賔。鳳翔後營將李楚琳殺其節度使張鎰，自稱留後。癸丑，李希烈陷襄城，宣武軍兵馬使高翼死之。甲寅，朱泚殺涇原節度都虞候何明禮。乙卯，殺尚書右僕射崔寧。丁巳，戶部尚書蕭復為吏部尚書，吏部郎中劉從一為刑部侍郎，京兆府戶曹參軍、翰林學士姜公輔為諫議大夫：同中書門下平章事。朱泚犯奉天，禁軍敗績于城東。辛酉，靈鹽節度留後杜希全、鄜坊節度使李建徽及朱泚戰于漠谷，敗績。癸亥，劉德信及泚戰于思子陵，敗之。甲子，行在都虞候渾瑊及泚戰于城下，敗之，左龍武軍大將軍呂希倩死之。乙丑，將軍高重傑死之。是月，商州軍亂，殺其刺史謝良輔。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月，劍南西山兵馬使張朏逐其節度使張延賞，朏伏誅。癸巳，李懷光及朱泚戰于魯店，敗之。懷光為中書令、朔方邠寧同華陝虢河中晉絳慈隰行營兵馬副元帥。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月，朱泚陷華州。壬戌，貶盧杞為新州司馬。庚午，李希烈陷汴、鄭二州。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"興元元年正月癸酉，大赦，改元。去「聖神文武」號。復李希烈、田悅、王武俊、李納官爵。赴奉天收京城將士有罪減三等，子孫減二等，在行營者賜勳五轉。賜文武官階、勳、爵。罷間架、竹木茶漆稅及除陌錢。給復奉天五年，城中十年。關播罷。丙戌，吏部侍郎盧翰為兵部侍郎、同中書門下平章事。戊子，蕭復為山南東西、荊湖、淮南、江西、鄂岳、浙江東西、福建、嶺南宣慰安撫使。戊戌，劉洽為汴滑宋亳都統副使。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月甲子，李懷光為太尉，懷光反。丁卯，如梁州。懷光將孟庭保以兵來追，左衛大將軍侯仲莊敗之于驛店。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月，李懷光奪鄜坊京畿金商節度使李建徽、神策軍兵馬使陽惠元兵，惠元死之。癸酉，魏博兵馬使田緒殺其節度使田悅，自稱留後。甲戌，李懷光殺左廂兵馬使張名振、右武鋒兵馬使石演芬。丁亥，李晟為京畿、渭北、鄜坊丹延節度招討使，神策行營兵馬使尚可孤為神策、京畿、渭南、商州節度招討使。壬辰，次梁州。丁酉，劉洽權知汴滑宋亳都統兵馬事。己亥，渾瑊為朔方、邠寧、振武、永平、奉天行營兵馬副元帥。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月，李懷光陷坊州。甲辰，李晟為京畿、渭北、商華兵馬副元帥。甲寅，姜公輔罷。涇原兵馬使田希鑒殺其節度使馮河清，自稱留後。乙丑，渾瑊及朱泚戰于武亭川，敗之。丁卯，義王玼薨。是月，坊州刺史竇覦克坊州。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月癸酉，涇王侹薨。丙子，李抱真、王武俊及朱滔戰于經城，敗之。壬辰，尚可孤及朱泚戰于藍田之西，敗之。乙未，李晟又敗之于苑北。戊戌，又敗之于白華，復京師。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月癸卯，姚令言伏誅。甲辰，朱泚伏誅。己酉，李晟為司徒、中書令。癸丑，以梁州為興元府，給復一年，耆老加版授。甲寅，渾瑊為侍中。己巳，給復洋州一年，加給興元一年，免鳳州今歲稅，父老加版授。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月丙子，次鳳翔，免今歲秋稅，八十以上版授刺史，餘授上佐。丁丑，葬宗室遇害者。壬午，至自興元。丁亥，李懷光殺宣慰使孔巢父。辛卯，大赦。賜百官將士階、勳、爵，收京城者升八資。給復京兆府一年。是月，嗣曹王皐及李希烈戰于應山，敗之。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月癸卯，李晟為鳳翔隴右諸軍、涇原四鎮北庭行營兵馬副元帥，馬燧為晉、慈、隰諸軍行營兵馬副元帥，渾瑊為河中、同絳、陝虢諸軍行營兵馬副元帥。丙午，渾瑊兼朔方行營兵馬副元帥。己酉，延王玢、隋王迅薨。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月辛丑，李勉檢校司徒、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月戊子，李希烈將李澄以滑州降。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月癸卯，劉洽、邠隴行營節度使曲環及李希烈戰于陳州，敗之。戊午，克汴州。乙丑，蕭復罷。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月乙酉，渾瑊及李懷光戰于乾坑，敗績。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，陳王珪薨。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"貞元元年正月丁酉，大赦，改元。罷榷稅。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月，李懷光殺步軍兵馬使田仙浩、都虞候呂鳴岳。丁未，李希烈陷鄧州，殺唐鄧隋招討使黃金岳。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是春，旱。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月乙丑，徙封誼為舒王。壬午，渾瑊及李懷光戰于長春宮，敗之。丙戌，馬燧、渾瑊為河中招撫使。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月己丑，幽州盧龍軍節度使朱滔卒，涿州刺史劉怦自稱留後。辛卯，劍南西川節度使張延賞為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。戊子，馬燧及李懷光戰于陶城，敗之。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月，灞、滻竭。庚子，大風拔木。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月，襲封配饗功臣子孫。甲子，以旱避正殿，減膳。甲戌，李懷光伏誅。己卯，給復河中、同絳二州一年。馬燧為侍中，張延賞罷。丙戌，李希烈殺宣慰使顏真卿。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月辛亥，劉從一罷。庚申，幽州盧龍軍節度使劉怦卒，其子濟自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是秋，雨木冰。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月癸卯，有事于南郊，大赦，賜奉天興元扈從百官、收京將士階、勳、爵。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二年正月丙申，詔減御膳之半，賙貧乏者授以官。壬寅，盧翰罷。吏部侍郎劉滋為左散騎常侍，給事中崔造，中書舍人齊映：同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月癸亥，山南東道節度使樊澤及李希烈戰于泌河，敗之。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月丙寅，希烈伏誅。甲戌，雨土。甲申，給復淮西二年。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月，李希烈將李惠登以隋州降。己酉，地震。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月癸未，滄州刺史程日華卒，其子懷直自稱觀察留後。是月，淮西兵馬使吳少誠殺其節度使陳仙奇，自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月，李希烈將薛翼以唐州降，侯召以光州降。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月丙子，大雨雹。丙戌，吐蕃寇邠、寧、涇、隴四州。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月乙巳，寇好畤，李晟敗之于汧陽。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月癸酉，邠寧節度使韓游瓌又敗之于平川。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月甲午，立淑妃王氏為皇后。丁酉，皇后崩。辛丑，吐蕃陷鹽州。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月丁巳，陷夏州。馬燧為綏、銀、麟、勝招討使。庚申，崔造罷。甲戌，以吐蕃寇邊，避正殿。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三年正月壬寅，尚書左僕射張延賞同中書門下平章事。壬子，劉滋罷。貶齊映為夔州刺史。兵部侍郎柳渾同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月己卯，華州潼關節度使駱元光克鹽、夏二州。甲申，葬昭德皇后于靖陵。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月丁未，李晟為太尉。辛亥，馬燧罷副元帥。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月，揚州江溢。吳少誠殺申州刺史張伯元、殿中侍御史鄭常。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月辛未，渾瑊及吐蕃盟于平涼，吐蕃執會盟副使、兵部尚書崔漢衡，殺判官、殿中侍御史韓弇。戊寅，太白晝見。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月，吐蕃寇鹽、夏二州。丙戌，馬燧為司徙，前陝虢觀察使李泌為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月甲子，朔方節度使杜希全為朔方、靈鹽、豐夏綏銀節度都統。壬申，張延賞薨。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月辛巳朔，日有食之。己丑，柳渾罷。戊申，吐蕃寇青石嶺，隴州刺史蘇清沔敗之。庚戌，禁大馬出蒲、潼、武關。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丁巳，吐蕃寇汧陽。丙寅，陷華亭及連雲堡。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月甲申，寇豐義，韓游瓌敗之。乙酉，寇長武城，城使韓全義敗之。壬辰，射生將韓欽緒謀反，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月己卯，京師、東都、河中地震。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月庚辰，獵于新店。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四年正月庚戌朔，京師地震。大赦，刺史予一子官，增戶墾田者加階，縣令減選，九品以上官言事。壬申，劉玄佐為四鎮北庭行營、涇原節度副元帥。是月，金、房二州地震，江溢山裂。雨木冰于陳留。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月，河南、淮海地生毛。己亥，福建軍亂，逐其觀察使吳詵，大將郝誡溢自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月，吐蕃寇涇、邠、寧、慶、鄜五州。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月己亥，封子謜為邕王。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月庚戌，渾瑊為邠、寧、慶副元帥。癸丑，寧州軍亂，邠寧都虞候楊朝晟敗之。己未，奚、室韋寇振武。是月，河水黑。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月，灞水溢。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月庚申，吐蕃寇寧州，邠寧節度使張獻甫敗之。冬，築夾城。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，京師地震二十。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五年正月甲辰朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月庚子，大理卿董晉為門下侍郎，御史大夫竇參為中書侍郎：同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月甲辰，李泌薨。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"夏，吐蕃寇長武城，韓全義敗之于佛堂原。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丙午，劍南西川節度使韋皐敗吐蕃于臺登北谷，克巂州。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，嶺南節度使李復克瓊州。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六年春，旱。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏四月乙卯，詔常參官、畿縣令言事。免京兆府夏稅。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月辛丑，殺皇太子妃蕭氏。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月戊辰，朝獻于太清宮。己巳，朝享于太廟。庚午，有事于南郊。賜文武官階、爵。降囚罪，徒以下原之。葬戰亡暴骨者。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，吐蕃陷北庭都護府，節度使楊襲古奔于西州。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七年正月己巳，襄王僙薨。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月，安南首領杜英翰反，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月甲申，端王遇薨。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月，回鶻殺楊襲古。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月戊戌，睦王述薨。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八年二月庚子，雨土。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月甲申，宣武軍節度使劉玄佐卒，其子士寧自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月，吐蕃寇靈州。丁亥，殺左諫議大夫知制誥吳通玄。乙未，貶竇參為郴州別駕。尚書左丞趙憬、兵部侍郎陸贄為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月己未，大風發太廟屋瓦。癸酉，平盧軍節度使李納卒，其子師古自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月，淮水溢。吐蕃寇連雲堡，大將王進用死之。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丁巳，韋皐及吐蕃戰于維州，敗之。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月壬子朔，日有食之。庚午，山南西道節度使嚴震及吐蕃戰于黑水堡，敗之。是月，幽州盧龍軍節度使劉濟及其弟瀛州刺史澭戰于瀛州，澭敗，奔于京師。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月甲辰，獵于城東。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九年正月癸卯，復稅茶。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月辛酉，關輔、河中地震。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月甲辰，義成軍節度使賈耽為尚書右僕射，尚書右丞盧邁：同中書門下平章事。丙午，董晉罷。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月庚戌，李晟薨。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月癸未，朝獻于太清宮。甲申，朝享于太廟。乙酉，有事于南郊，大赦。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月丙辰，宣武軍將李萬榮逐其節度使劉士寧，自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十年正月壬辰，南詔蠻敗吐蕃于神川，來獻捷。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月癸卯朔，赦京城。戊申，地震。癸丑，又震。是月，太白晝見。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月丙寅，韋皐敗吐蕃，克峨和城。自春不雨至于是月。辛未，雨，大風拔木。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月，西原蠻叛。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月，陷欽、橫、潯、貴四州。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，昭義軍節度留後王虔休及攝洺州刺史元誼戰于雞澤，敗之。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月丙辰，獵于城南。壬戌，貶陸贄為太子賔客。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一年四月丙寅，奚寇平州，劉濟敗之于青都山。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月庚午，中書門下慮囚。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月辛亥，馬燧薨。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月，橫海軍兵馬使程懷信逐其兄節度使懷直，自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，朗、蜀二州江溢。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月戊辰，獵于苑中。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二年二月己卯，吐蕃寇巂州，刺史曹高仕敗之。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月丙辰，韶王暹薨。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月庚午，魏博節度使田緒卒，其子季安自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月己丑，宣武軍節度使李萬榮卒，其子迺自稱兵馬使，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月戊戌，韓王迥薨。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月己未朔，日有食之。丙戌，趙憬薨。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月，吐蕃寇慶州。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月甲戌，右諫議大夫崔損、給事中趙宗儒同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十三年正月壬寅，吐蕃請和。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月辛酉，以旱慮囚。壬戌，雩于興慶宮。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月壬寅，吐蕃寇巂州，曹高仕敗之。庚戌，義寧軍亂，殺其將常楚客。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月乙未，京師地震。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月己丑，盧邁罷。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十四年三月丙申，鳳翔監軍使西門去奢殺其將夏侯衍。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月己酉，始雷。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月辛亥，有星隕于西北。辛酉，長武城軍亂，逐其使韓全義。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月丙申，歸化堡軍亂，逐其將張國誠，涇原節度使劉昌敗之。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月壬申，趙宗儒罷。工部侍郎鄭餘慶為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丁卯，杞王倕薨。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月壬寅，明州將栗鍠殺其刺史盧雲以反。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪，京師饑。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十五年正月甲寅，雅王逸薨。壬戌，郴州藍山崩。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月乙酉，宣武軍亂，殺節度行軍司馬陸長源，宋州刺史劉逸淮自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月甲寅，彰義軍節度使吳少誠反，陷唐州，守將張嘉瑜死之。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月乙未，栗鍠伏誅。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月乙巳，陳許節度留後上官涗及吳少誠戰于臨潁，敗績。丙午，少誠寇許州。庚戌，宣武軍節度使劉全諒卒，都知兵馬使韓弘自稱留後。丙辰，宣武、河陽、鄭滑、東都汝、成德、幽州、淄青、魏博、易定、澤潞、河東、淮南、徐泗、山南東西、鄂岳軍討吳少誠。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月己丑，邕王謜薨。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月丁未，山南東道節度使于頔及吳少誠戰于吳房，敗之。陳許節度使上官涗又敗之于柴籬。辛亥，安黃節度使伊慎又敗之于鍾山。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月庚午，壽州刺史王宗又敗之于秋柵。辛未，渾瑊薨。乙未，諸道兵潰于小溵河。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十六年正月乙巳，易定兵及吳少誠戰，敗績。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月乙酉，鹽夏綏銀節度使韓全義為蔡州行營招討處置使，上官涗副之。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月丁亥，黔中宴設將傅近逐其觀察使吳士宗。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月庚戌，韓全義及吳少誠戰于廣利城，敗績。壬子，徐泗濠節度使張建封卒，其子愔自稱知軍事。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月丁巳，伊慎及吳少誠戰于申州，敗之。己未，韋皐克吐蕃末恭城。丙寅，韓全義及吳少誠戰于五樓，敗績。","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月，劉濟及其弟涿州刺史源戰于涿州，源敗，執之。己丑，殺遂州別駕崔位。韋皐克吐蕃顒城。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月庚戌，貶鄭餘慶為郴州司馬。庚申，太常卿齊抗為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月辛未，殺通州別駕崔河圖。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，京師饑。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十七年二月丁酉，大雨雹。己亥，霜。乙巳，韋皐及吐蕃戰于鹿危山，敗之。戊申，大雨雹，震電。庚戌，大雪，雨雹。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月壬戌朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月丙申，寧州軍亂，殺其刺史劉南金。己亥，浙西觀察使李錡殺上封事人崔善貞。丁巳，成德軍節度使王武俊卒，其子士真自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月，隕霜殺菽。戊寅，吐蕃寇鹽州。己丑，陷麟州，刺史郭鋒死之。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月乙亥，韋皐敗吐蕃于雅州，克木波城。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，嘉王運薨。","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十八年七月乙亥，罷正衙奏事。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月，環王陷驩、愛二州。","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十九年二月己亥，安南將王季元逐其經略使裴泰，兵馬使趙均敗之。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月壬子，淮南節度使杜佑檢校司空、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月己未，齊抗罷。自正月不雨至于是月。甲戌，雨。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏十月庚戌，鹽州將李庭俊反，伏誅。丁巳，崔損薨。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月庚申，太常卿高郢為中書侍郎，吏部侍郎鄭珣瑜為門下侍郎：同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二十年二月庚戌，大雨雹。七月癸酉，大雨雹。","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"冬，雨木冰。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二十一年正月癸巳，皇帝崩于會寧殿，年六十四。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"順宗至德弘道大聖大安孝皇帝諱誦，德宗長子也。母曰昭德皇后王氏。始封宣城郡王，大曆十四年六月，進封宣王。十二月乙卯，立為皇太子。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"為人寬仁，喜學藝，善隸書，禮重師傅，見輒先拜。從德宗幸奉天，常執弓矢居左右。郜國公主以蠱事得罪，太子妃，其女也，德宗疑之，幾廢者屢矣，賴李泌保護，乃免。後侍宴魚藻宮，張水嬉綵艦，宮人為櫂歌，衆樂間發，德宗驩甚，顧太子曰：「今日何如？」太子誦詩「好樂無荒」以為對。及裴延齡、韋渠牟用事，世皆畏其為相，太子每候顏色，陳其不可。故二人者卒不得用。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"貞元二十年，太子病風且瘖。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二十一年正月，不能朝。是時，德宗不豫，諸王皆侍左右，惟太子卧病，不能見，德宗悲傷涕泣，疾有加。癸巳，德宗崩。丙申，即皇帝位于太極殿。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月癸卯，朝羣臣于紫宸門。辛亥，吏部侍郎韋執誼為尚書左丞、同中書門下平章事。甲子，大赦。罷宮市。民百歲版授下州刺史，婦人郡君；九十以上上佐，婦人縣君。乙丑，罷鹽鐵使月進。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月庚午，放後宮三百人。癸酉，放後宮及教坊女妓六百人。癸巳，立廣陵郡王純為皇太子。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月壬寅，封弟諤為欽王，諴珍王；進封子建康郡王經郯王，洋川郡王緯均王，臨淮郡王縱漵王，弘農郡王紓莒王，漢東郡王綱密王，晉陵郡王總郇王，高平郡王約邵王，雲安郡王結宋王，宣城郡王緗集王，德陽郡王絿冀王，河東郡王綺和王；封子絢為衡王，纁會王，綰福王，紘撫王，緄岳王，紳袁王，綸桂王，繟翼王。戊申，以冊皇太子，降死罪以下，賜文武官子為父後者勳兩轉。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月辛卯，橫海軍節度使程懷信卒，其子執恭自稱留後。乙未，皇太子權句當軍國政事。太常卿杜黃裳為門下侍郎，左金吾衛大將軍袁滋為中書侍郎：同中書門下平章事。鄭珣瑜、高郢罷。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"永貞元年八月庚子，立皇太子為皇帝，自稱曰太上皇。辛丑，改元。降死罪以下。立良娣王氏為太上皇后。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"元和元年正月，皇帝率羣臣上尊號曰應乾聖壽太上皇。是月，崩于咸寧殿，年四十六，謚曰至德大聖大安孝皇帝。大中三年，增謚至德弘道大聖大安孝皇帝。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"憲宗昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝諱純，順宗長子也。母曰莊憲皇太后王氏。貞元四年六月己亥，封廣陵郡王。二十一年三月，立為皇太子。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"永貞元年八月，順宗詔立為皇帝。乙巳，即皇帝位于太極殿。丁未，始聽政。庚戌，罷獻祥瑞。癸丑，劍南西川節度使韋皐卒，行軍司馬劉闢自稱留後。戊午，天有聲于西北。己未，袁滋為劍南西川、山南西道安撫大使。癸亥，尚書左丞鄭餘慶同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月己巳，罷教坊樂工正員官。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月丁酉，為曾太皇太后舉哀。賈耽薨。戊戌，舒王誼薨。袁滋罷。己酉，葬神武聖文皇帝于崇陵。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月己巳，祔睿真皇后于元陵寢宮。壬申，貶韋執誼為崖州司馬。夏綏銀節度留後楊惠琳反。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月壬戌，中書舍人鄭絪為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"元和元年正月丁卯，大赦，改元。賜文武官階、勳、爵，民高年者米帛羊酒。癸未，長武城使高崇文為左神策行營節度使，率左右神策京西行營兵馬使李元奕、山南西道節度使嚴礪、劍南東川節度使李康以討劉闢。甲申，太上皇崩。劉闢陷梓州，執李康。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月丙子，高崇文克梓州。辛巳，楊惠琳伏誅。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月丁未，杜佑為司徒。壬戌，邵王約薨。初令尚書省六品、諸司四品以上職事官，太子師傅、賔客、詹事，王府傅，日二人待制。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月辛卯，尊母為皇太后。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月癸巳，降死罪以下。賜百姓有父母祖父母八十以上者粟二斛、物二段，九十以上粟三斛、物三段。丙申，大風拔木。丁酉，高崇文及劉闢戰于鹿頭柵，敗之。癸卯，嚴礪又敗之于石碑谷。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月壬戌，平盧軍節度使李師古卒，其弟師道自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月壬寅，葬至德大聖大安孝皇帝于豐陵。癸丑，高崇文及劉闢戰于玄武，敗之。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月丁卯，進封子平原郡王寧為鄧王，同安郡王寬澧王，延安郡王宥遂王，彭城郡王察深王，高密郡王寰洋王，文安郡王寮絳王；封子審為建王。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丙午，嚴礪及劉闢戰于神泉，敗之。辛亥，高崇文克成都。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月甲子，減劍南東西川、山南西道今歲賦，釋脅從將吏。葬陣亡者，稟其家五歲。戊子，劉闢伏誅。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月庚戌，鄭餘慶罷。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，召王偲薨。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二年正月己丑，朝獻于太清宮。庚寅，朝享于太廟。辛卯，有事于南郊，大赦。賜文武官勳、爵，文宣公、二王後、三恪、公主、諸王一子官，高年米帛羊酒加版授。乙巳，杜黃裳罷。己酉，御史中丞武元衡為門下侍郎，中書舍人李吉甫為中書侍郎：同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月己巳，罷兩省官次對。癸酉，邕管經略使路恕敗黃洞蠻，執其首領黃承慶。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月乙酉，密王綢薨。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，鎮海軍節度使李錡反，殺留後王澹。乙丑，淮南節度使王鍔為諸道行營兵馬招討使以討之。丁卯，武元衡罷。癸酉，鎮海軍兵馬使張子良執李錡。己卯，免潤州今歲稅。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月甲申，李錡伏誅。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月丙寅，劍南西川節度使高崇文為邠寧節度、京西諸軍都統。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三年正月癸巳，羣臣上尊號曰睿聖文武皇帝，大赦。罷諸道受代進奉錢。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月癸巳，郇王總薨。","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月壬申，大風壞含元殿西闕檻。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月，西原蠻首領黃少卿降。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月辛巳朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月庚寅，山南東道節度使于頔為司空、同中書門下平章事。丙申，戶部侍郎裴垍為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。戊戌，李吉甫罷。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四年正月壬午，免山南東道、淮南、江西、浙東、湖南、荊南今歲稅。戊子，簡王遘薨。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月丁卯，鄭絪罷。給事中李藩為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月乙酉，成德軍節度使王士真卒，其子承宗自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月己酉，以旱降京師死罪非殺人者，禁刺史境內榷率、諸道旨條外進獻、嶺南黔中福建掠良民為奴婢者，省飛龍廄馬。己未，雨。丁卯，立鄧王寧為皇太子。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月癸亥，吐蕃請和。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月丙申，環王寇安南，都護張舟敗之。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月辛巳，成德軍節度使王承宗反，執保信軍節度使薛昌朝。癸未，左神策軍護軍中尉吐突承璀為左右神策、河陽、浙西、宣歙、鎮州行營兵馬招討處置使以討之。戊子，承璀為鎮州招討宣慰使。癸巳，降死罪以下，賜文武官子為父後者勳兩轉。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月己巳，彰義軍節度使吳少誠卒，其弟少陽自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五年正月己巳，左神策軍大將軍酈定進及王承宗戰，死之。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月甲子，大風拔木。","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月丁亥，河東節度使范希朝、義武軍節度使張茂昭及王承宗戰于木刀溝，敗之。","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月丁未，赦王承宗。乙卯，幽州盧龍軍節度使劉濟卒，其子總自稱留後。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丙寅，太常卿權德輿為禮部尚書、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，張茂昭以易、定二州歸于有司。辛巳，義武軍都虞候楊伯玉反，伏誅。是月，義武軍兵馬使張佐元反，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月甲辰，會王纁薨。庚申，裴垍罷。","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六年正月庚申，淮南節度使李吉甫為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月壬申，李藩罷。己丑，忻王造薨。","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月戊戌，有星隕于鄆州。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月己丑，戶部侍郎李絳為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏月辛卯，辰、漵州首領張伯靖反，寇播、費二州。辛亥，皇太子薨。","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七年正月癸酉，振武河溢，毀東受降城。","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月癸巳，詔民田畝樹桑二。","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月癸巳，杜佑罷。","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月乙亥，立遂王宥為皇太子。","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月戊戌，魏博節度使田季安卒，其子懷諫自稱知軍府事。","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月，京師地震。","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月乙未，魏博軍以田季安之將田興知軍事。庚戌，降死罪以下，賜文武官子為父後者勳兩轉。是月，魏博節度使田興以六州歸于有司。","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月辛酉，赦魏、博、貝、衛、澶、相六州，給復一年，賜高年、孤獨、廢疾粟帛，賞軍士。","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八年正月辛未，權德輿罷。","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月丁酉，貶于頔為恩王傅。","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月甲子，劍南西川節度使武元衡為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月己亥，黔中經略使崔能討張伯靖。","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月癸亥，荊南節度使嚴綬討伯靖。丁丑，大隗山崩。","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_278","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月辛卯，渭水溢。辛丑，出宮人。","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月己巳，劍南東川節度使潘孟陽討張伯靖。","sentenceOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月辛巳，湖南觀察使柳公綽討伯靖。丁未，伯靖降。","sentenceOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月庚寅，振武將楊遵憲反，逐其節度使李進賢。","sentenceOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九年二月癸卯，李絳罷。","sentenceOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_283","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月丙辰，巂州地震。丁卯，隕霜殺桑。","sentenceOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月乙丑，桂王綸薨。癸酉，以旱免京畿夏稅。","sentenceOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月壬寅，河中節度使張弘靖為刑部尚書、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":285},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_286","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"閏八月丙辰，彰義軍節度使吳少陽卒，其子元濟自稱知軍事。","sentenceOrder":286},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_287","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丁亥，山南東道節度使嚴綬、忠武軍都知兵馬使李光顏、壽州團練使李文通、河陽節度使烏重胤討之。","sentenceOrder":287},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_288","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，太白晝見。丙午，李吉甫薨。甲子，嚴綬為申、光、蔡招撫使。","sentenceOrder":288},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_289","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月戊子，罷京兆府臘獻狐兔。","sentenceOrder":289},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_290","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月，詔刑部、大理官朔望入對。戊辰，尚書右丞韋貫之同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":290},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_291","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十年正月乙酉，宣武軍節度使韓弘為司徒。","sentenceOrder":291},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_292","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月甲辰，嚴綬及吳元濟戰于磁丘，敗績。自冬不雨至于是月。丙午，雪。壬戌，河東戍將劉輔殺豐州刺史燕重旰，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":292},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_293","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月庚子，忠武軍節度使李光顏及吳元濟戰于臨潁，敗之。四月甲辰，又敗之于南頓。五月丙申，又敗之于時曲。","sentenceOrder":293},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_294","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月癸卯，盜殺武元衡。戊申，京師大索。乙丑，御史中丞裴度為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":294},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_295","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月甲戌，王承宗有罪，絕其朝貢。","sentenceOrder":295},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_296","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月己亥朔，日有食之。丁未，李師道將訾嘉珍反于東都，留守呂元膺敗之。乙丑，李光顏及吳元濟戰于時曲，敗績。","sentenceOrder":296},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_297","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月癸酉，韓弘為淮西行營兵馬都統。","sentenceOrder":297},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_298","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月，地震。","sentenceOrder":298},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_299","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月壬申，李光顏、烏重胤及吳元濟戰于小溵河，敗之。丁丑，李文通又敗之于固始。戊寅，盜焚獻陵寢宮。","sentenceOrder":299},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_300","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月甲辰，武寧軍都押衙王智興及李師道戰于平陰，敗之。","sentenceOrder":300},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_301","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，丹王逾薨。","sentenceOrder":301},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_302","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一年正月己巳，張弘靖罷。乙亥，幽州盧龍軍節度使劉總及王承宗戰于武彊，敗之。癸未，免鄰賊州二歲稅。甲申，盜斷建陵門戟。","sentenceOrder":302},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_303","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月庚子，王承宗焚蔚州。乙巳，中書舍人李逢吉為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。乙丑，地震。","sentenceOrder":303},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_304","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月庚午，皇太后崩。","sentenceOrder":304},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_305","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月庚子，李光顏、烏重胤及吳元濟戰于凌雲柵，敗之。乙卯，劉總及王承宗戰于深州，敗之。己未，免京畿二歲逋稅。","sentenceOrder":305},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_306","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"五月丁卯，宥州軍亂，逐其刺史駱怡，夏綏銀節度使田縉敗之。丁亥，雲南蠻寇安南。","sentenceOrder":306},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_307","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月，密州海溢。甲辰，唐鄧節度使高霞寓及吳元濟戰于鐵城，敗績。","sentenceOrder":307},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_308","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月壬午，韓弘及元濟戰于郾城，敗之。丙戌，免淮西鄰賊州夏稅。","sentenceOrder":308},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_309","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月甲午，渭水溢。壬寅，韋貫之罷。戊申，西原蠻陷賔、巒二州。己未，昭義軍節度使郗士美及王承宗戰于柏鄉，敗之。庚申，葬莊憲皇太后于豐陵。","sentenceOrder":309},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_310","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月乙丑，邕管經略使韋悅克賔、巒二州。甲戌，元陵火。","sentenceOrder":310},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_311","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月丁未，翰林學士、工部侍郎王涯為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。己未，西原蠻陷巖州。","sentenceOrder":311},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_312","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是冬，桃李華。","sentenceOrder":312},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_313","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二年正月丁丑，地震。戊子，有彗星出于畢。","sentenceOrder":313},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_314","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月辛卯，唐鄧隋節度使李愬及吳元濟戰于嵖岈山，敗之。乙未，李光顏又敗之于郾城。五月辛酉，李愬又敗之于張柴。","sentenceOrder":314},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_315","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月丙辰，裴度為淮西宣慰處置使，戶部侍郎崔羣為中書侍郎：同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":315},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_316","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月癸亥，烏重胤及吳元濟戰于賈店，敗績。","sentenceOrder":316},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_317","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月丁未，李逢吉罷。甲寅，李愬及吳元濟戰于吳房，敗之。","sentenceOrder":317},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_318","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月癸酉，克蔡州。甲戌，淮南節度使李鄘為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。甲申，給復淮西二年，免旁州來歲夏稅。葬戰士，稟其家五年。","sentenceOrder":318},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_319","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月丙戌，吳元濟伏誅。甲午，恩王連薨。","sentenceOrder":319},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_320","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"是歲，容管經略使陽旻克欽、橫、潯、貴四州。","sentenceOrder":320},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_321","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十三年正月乙酉，大赦，免元和二年以前逋負，賜高年米帛羊酒。","sentenceOrder":321},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_322","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"三月戊戌，御史大夫李夷簡為門下侍郎、同中書門下平章事。李鄘罷。己酉，橫海軍節度使程權以滄、景二州歸于有司，權朝于京師。","sentenceOrder":322},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_323","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月甲寅，王承宗獻德、棣二州。庚辰，赦承宗。","sentenceOrder":323},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_324","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"六月癸丑朔，日有食之。癸亥，給復德、棣、滄、景四州一年。辛未，淮水溢。","sentenceOrder":324},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_325","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月乙酉，宣武、魏博、義成、橫海軍討李師道。辛丑，李夷簡罷。","sentenceOrder":325},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_326","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月壬子，王涯罷。","sentenceOrder":326},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_327","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月甲辰，戶部侍郎皇甫鎛，諸道鹽鐵轉運使程异為工部侍郎：同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":327},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_328","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月壬戌，吐蕃寇宥州，靈武節度使杜叔良敗之于定遠城。","sentenceOrder":328},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_329","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月丁亥，命山人柳泌為台州刺史以求藥。","sentenceOrder":329},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_330","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月，庚戌，迎佛骨于鳳翔。","sentenceOrder":330},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_331","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十四年正月丙午，田弘正及李師道戰于陽穀，敗之。","sentenceOrder":331},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_332","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"二月戊午，師道伏誅。","sentenceOrder":332},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_333","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"四月辛未，程异薨。丙子，裴度罷。","sentenceOrder":333},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_334","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"七月戊寅，韓弘以汴、宋、亳、潁四州歸于有司，弘朝于京師。己丑，羣臣上尊號曰元和聖文神武法天應道皇帝。大赦，賜文武官階、勳、爵。遣黜陟使于天下。辛卯，沂海將王弁殺其觀察使王遂，自稱留後。丁酉，河陽節度使令狐楚為中書侍郎、同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":334},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_335","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"八月己酉，韓弘為中書令。","sentenceOrder":335},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_336","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"九月戊寅，王弁伏誅。","sentenceOrder":336},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_337","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十月壬戌，安南將楊清殺其都護李象古以反。癸酉，吐蕃寇鹽州。","sentenceOrder":337},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_338","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十一月辛卯，朔方將史敬奉及吐蕃戰于瓠蘆河，敗之。","sentenceOrder":338},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_339","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十二月乙卯，崔羣罷。","sentenceOrder":339},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_340","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"十五年正月，宦者陳弘志等反。庚子，皇帝崩，年四十三，謚曰聖神章武孝皇帝。大中三年，加謚昭文章武大聖至神孝皇帝。","sentenceOrder":340},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_7_341","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_7","textTraditional":"贊曰：德宗猜忌刻薄，以彊明自任，恥見屈於正論，而忘受欺於姦諛。故其疑蕭復之輕己，謂姜公輔為賣直，而不能容；用盧杞、趙贊，則至於敗亂，而終不悔。及奉天之難，深自懲艾，遂行姑息之政。由是朝廷益弱，而方鎮愈彊，至於唐亡，其患以此。憲宗剛明果斷，自初即位，慨然發憤，志平僭叛，能用忠謀，不惑羣議，卒收成功。自吳元濟誅，彊藩悍將皆欲悔過而效順。當此之時，唐之威令，幾於復振，則其為優劣，不待較而可知也。及其晚節，信用非人，不終其業，而身罹不測之禍，則尤甚於德宗。嗚呼！小人之能敗國也，不必愚君暗主，雖聦明聖智，苟有惑焉，未有不為患者也。昔韓愈言，順宗在東宮二十年，天下陰受其賜。然享國日淺，不幸疾病，莫克有為，亦可以悲夫！","sentenceOrder":341}],"overrides":{}}